    {
      "id": "update-003",
      "campaignId": "campaign-003",
      "title": "Goal reached! Thank you!",
      "content": "We did it! Thanks to 89 generous donors, we've reached our CHF 30,000 goal for the 2025-2026 scholarship fund.\n\nApplications are now open for:\n- 10 professional certification scholarships (up to CHF 1,500 each)\n- 5 language course scholarships (up to CHF 2,000 each)\n- 2 executive education scholarships (up to CHF 5,000 each)\n\nApply through your member portal by January 31st.",
